      "title": {
        "en": "Warm and compassionate veterinary staff"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners widely praise the entire team at Westwood Vets in Garforth for their kind and professional demeanour. Reviewers frequently highlight the friendly receptionists and single out veterinary nurses like Becky for making routine visits pleasant. Clients consistently report feeling supported by attentive clinicians who take time to listen to all health queries."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 18,
      "title": {
        "en": "Patient care for nervous animals"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers repeatedly emphasize how wonderful staff are with pets of all temperaments, including anxious rescues and excitable dogs. Pet parents describe how clinicians use treats and gentle handling techniques to calm snappy or frightened animals during physical examinations. Owners note that dogs and cats leave clinic consultations settled and unhurried."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 6,
      "title": {
        "en": "Clear explanations and treatment guidance"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients appreciate the thorough discussions provided by clinicians before examinations and surgical procedures take place. Pet parents value receiving prompt updates regarding surgery progress and aftercare arrangements, alongside automated reminders for routine parasite treatments. Owners describe feeling fully informed and confident regarding clinical decisions."
      }
    }
  ],
